  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Dive into a touching story.</b><p></p>\n<p>The little boy Kiddo has spent most of his life in the hospital. Little does he know what a complicated and fascinating world lies concealed beyond the hospital walls.</p>\n<p>Today, on Kiddo’s birthday, his mom wasn’t around. Instead of her, the boy met Shadow, who inspired him to escape from a hospital and search for his mom.</p>\n<p>Solve puzzles, hide and run from enemies, make friends, and help the boy get home.</p>\n<p>Real adventures lie in wait for Kiddo! Now his fate is in your hands…</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Look at ordinary things through the eyes of a child.\n</li><li>Help the boy overcome his illness.\n</li><li>Try to hide from troubles.\n</li><li>Play with a garbage rat.\n</li><li>Tame a puppy.\n</li><li>Hide in a public toilet.\n</li><li>Whisk the bees away from the honey.\n</li><li>Create a story about your adventures and document it in your album.\n</li><li>Explore a small town and unravel its mysteries.\n</li><li>Meet Shadow.\n</li><li>Keep the balance between light and dark by making tough decisions.\n</li><li>Learn the outcome of your unique playstyle.\n</li></ul>\n",
